%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: BleakFallsTrueEnd
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh, okay?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125651
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess I should head to bed, then.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125652
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Goodnight~!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125653
    - rid: 9079475045585125654
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418977
    - rid: 9079475089592287519
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm having trouble getting to sleep.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Honestly, I've always been a bit of a picky sleeper.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Even when I was sleeping over at Sayori's, a place that I'm familiar
      with and was objectively comfortable, I still had a rough go of it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... is there something wrong with me?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Maybe I should talk to a doctor about it when I get back.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I know this place doesn't have melatonin, but maybe there's a magical
      method to go to sleep?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I know there's poisons and spells to paralyze, so surely there'd be some
      to go to sleep?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There isn't anything like that in-game, so maybe there wouldn't be one?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Questions for later.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Psst, {mc}, are you awake?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I roll over in bed to look at the door, finding a singular Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714164
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'd rather not be, you need something?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714165
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I can't get to sleep either.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714166
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (... and what do you want me to do about that?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714167
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I said that a bit meaner than I wanted to, but, in my defense, I'm a
      sleepy boy!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (... I thought we could talk for a bit...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714168
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Haaahhh...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Fine. What's up?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714169
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Um-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714170
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (What's gonna be for breakfast?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714171
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (... breakfast. Really?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714172
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (I don't know Sayori, whatever the inn-keeper makes, I guess.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do you think there'll be any french toast?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714173
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wha-?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Sayori, how could there be french toast? France doesn't even exist in
      this place!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714174
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (A girl can dream, ehehe~...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (I mean, I think cinnamon still exists, and sugar definitely does...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714175
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (So all the stuff's there, but you'd have to have your own recipe.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (So we <i>can</i> have french toast for breakfast?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714176
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Not tomorrow, no.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714177
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Dang it!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Why are you so fixated on french toast, Sayori?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714178
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (... 'cause I want it!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (... okay.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: You big baby-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Stop thinking whatever mean thing you're thinking right now!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wha-?!?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yeah, okay, Ms. Thought Police...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714180
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Good!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714181
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: A smart Sayori is a scary Sayori...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714182
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh come on, that thought wasn't even that mean-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (So the first one was? Shame on you, {mc}!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714183
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I roll back over to face the wall next to my bed in protest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714184
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hey, I'm not done talking with you yet!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh, but <i>I</i> am. If you're just gonna be a stinker you can go talk
      to Yuri, or whatever.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (But Yuri's already asleep!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I think?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (What do you mean, you think?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, she's breathing pretty slow, but she started doing that as soon
      as she got in bed...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (So either she's a better sleeper than the both of us, or she's a very
      good actress.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (... did you try talking to her first?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Sayori?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (... no...?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (But isn't she <i>your</i> roommate, Sayori?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, yeah, but-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (... I wanted to talk to <i>you</i>...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I mean, it's been so long since we've had a sleepover, I thought...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I turn my head back around to face Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714185
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe it could help us get more comfortable if we did something... familiar?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714186
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... she's not exactly wrong.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'd probably be in a way worse state mentally if Sayori and the other
      girls weren't here with me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (So, uh...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714187
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Speaking of something familiar...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Scooch over and let me in!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714188
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Snuggling with Sayori...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm! That sounds pretty nice-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Nope.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714189
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wha-? Why not?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (This is a single bed, it doesn't have the room for both of us.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714190
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I don't mind getting close...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714191
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Uh, what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I thought she was just trying to replicate our childhood...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Is she, like, really horny or something? Jeez...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Okay, but I'm not wearing any clothes under these sheets.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714192
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Still want in?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... she's thinking about it seriously?!? That's gotta be a flag!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714193
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't know what color it would be, but it's definitely raised! Whatever
      it is!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'll go back to my room now...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714194
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475070362714195
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Did that just happen?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Good going, Sayori, now I really can't sleep!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <SineText=4>...</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I just had a <NoiseText=1,0.5>bad</NoiseText> thought...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Guh! Morning can't get here soon enough...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
